    "title": "miley [cropped sweater]",
    "product_url": "https://rebeccarowe.ca/products/miley-plaid",
    "description": "<p> </p>\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s2\">Boxy fitted sweater</span></li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s2\">Loose turtleneck</span></li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s2\">Raglan Sleeve with cuff</span></li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<li class=\"li1\"><span class=\"s2\">Cropped to waist (front length: 35cm)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<li class=\"li1\">\n<span class=\"s2\">High-low hem</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n<br><strong>Recommended retail price: $137.00</strong><br><br>Think about your favourite hoodie that you wish you could wear to work but you can't because there's a dress code. This is your pullover. Sweatshirt material but with all the style you could ever want. Wear it with your yoga pants for zoom meetings, or over a dress with some cute booties to get that fall vibe. <br><br>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Miley is a great layering piece. Cropped to your natural waist this top is great with the Shelby Pant, Linda Skirt, over Rachel... I could go on but you get the idea. Use her as a tool for helping create a waist or the illusion of a waist. </span></p>\n<br>  <br>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">Cold wash, lay flat to dry.</span></p>\n<br>--<br>\n<p><br></p>",
